    },
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なんか今日、こっちに来たがって……\r\nついてきたらプロデューサーさんがいました！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか……！\r\nマメ丸もおはよう。果穂を連れてきてくれたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0551",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはスーツだから……お仕事？\r\n今から事務所に行くんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、今日ってお休みなんじゃ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだったんだけどさ、\r\nちょっと昨日のうちに終わらなくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日やっちゃおうと思ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "残業ってことですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0454",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "──あれ？\r\nでも朝だからちがう……？　夜……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "決められた時間じゃない時に働くことだから、\r\n朝でも夜でも残業で合ってるよ。よく知ってるな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ\r\nおうちでたまに聞くので！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/2000009001/20000090010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 20000090010090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっか、プロデューサーさん\r\nこれからお仕事で、残業なんですね……大変だ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
